window.products.push({"id":765026,"name":"Pour Over Coffee Maker with Glass Funnel Pour Over - Pour Over Coffee Dripper - Reclaimed Wood and Pipe - 3-Cups (14 oz/400ml) (Charcoal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A4mlToOvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unleash your inner coffee aficionado The Iron & Sprout Pour Over Coffee Maker turns coffee-making into a fully hands-on experience. Assemble the wood base and steel pipe kit for a back-to-basics coffee dripper that highlights the finer quality of your beans. This eye-catching pour over kit is a conversation piece unto itself. With complete assembly instructions and our free guide to perfecting the use of filters, temperature and grounds, you'll treat your friends and family to extraordinary cups of bold, flavorful coffee. Bring out the best in every cup At the heart of our pour over coffee dripper is a superior borosilicate glass funnel that resists odor absorption and chemical residues. You'll also receive cone coffee filters made of natural, unbleached paper to ensure that your morning joe is the most consistent, even and flavorful cup you've ever savored. The Iron & Sprout Pour Over Coffee Maker comes with 2 glass vials and cork lids that stand upright on the wood base, keeping creamer or sweetener at your fingertips. Build it yourself in minutes Black steel pipes suspend a 100mm glass funnel in a 'T' fitting to create an eye-catching tabletop appliance. The base is also waterproofed to prevent water rings and to allow the entire unit to be wiped clean with a damp cloth and mild soap. Made of reclaimed natural lumber from East Coast architecture, each Iron & Sprout Pour Over Coffee Maker is assured of being a 1-of-a-kind housewarming, wedding or birthday gift. For the perfect cup of coffee, build the best coffee maker. Add the Iron & Sprout Pour Over Coffee Dripper Kit to your cart today. DIMENSIONS OF BASE: 13\" x 5.5\" x 1.5\" HEIGHT (with funnel): 13\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A4mlToOvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iron & Sprout","source_asin":"B07FQWPHW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FQWPHW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FQWPHW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
