window.products.push({"id":765049,"name":"Briard Cookie Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vCU9FUhDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a treat for a dog loving friend? Why not bake up a batch of Briard cookies! Don't feel like baking ~ these make great gifts too. Who wouldn't love a dog cookie cutter from a friend! Each cookie cutter is hand crafted in our workshop from heavy weight solid copper. This cookie cutter is built to last for many generations of cookie baking, fondant cutting, ornament making, or even use it for tracing quilt patterns. Made from very heavy weight copper to maintain shape while using and storing. Great for gift giving or as a centerpiece to a cookie bouquet! Each one is slightly different from the next as they are formed one at a time and hand soldered using lead-free silver solder. Listing is for one cookie cutter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vCU9FUhDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Fussy Pup","source_asin":"B00C4HGWUY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C4HGWUY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C4HGWUY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":765050,"name":"BIARTS 2 in 1 Universal Knife Block without Knives Stainless Steel Knife Holder for Kitchen Counter with Drainage Hole Knife Storage with Utensil Hold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dmRKf8TVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1, ✅【 Unique Drain Holes Design】Still worrying about the water in the bottom of the universal knife block without knives? BIARTS kitchen knife holder has convinent drainage holes with a detachable tray, the water won't drip to your countertop, can be dumped directly from the bottom, no need to take out the knifes or turn the it upside-down. The vents at the bottom make the tableware dry quickly and keep clean. 2, ✅【2 in 1 Design】BIARTS multifunctional knife blocks includes 2 separate compartments with big capacity : knife blocks and a kitchen utensils organizer. The universal knife block without knives can hold a scissors, a sharpening steel and 4 knives of 3 different sizes (3.7 in, 2.2 in, and 1.8 in width) . The kitchen knife holder can hold little knives, fork, scoop, scissor, eggbeater and etc. This compact knife organizer can save much space for the countertop, make your kitchen neat and clean. 3, ✅【Fully Detachable Structure】The bottom and the caddy can be disassembled for cleaning. The drain tray of the universal knife block without knives is snap design, easy to remove and install. Non-slip base with 4 rubber pads, which can avoid tipping over when you take the brush out from the kitchen knife holder, also can avoid scratching your pretty countertop. 4, ✅【Anti-fingerprint Stainless Steel】Made of selected anti-fingerprint stainless steel and ABS, durable, can last for years. BIARTS 2-in-1 universal knife block without knives features an upscale, brushed metal finish that resists fingerprints and smudges to preserve a sleek. Just clean up the kitchen knife holder with a damp paper towel, because the anti-fingerprint design can keep the surface clean and shiny. 5,✅【Satisfaction Guaranteed】 Your satisfaction is our priority and We value every suggestion of our customers. If you have any issues with our item, please feel free to contact us and we will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dmRKf8TVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIARTS","source_asin":"B0BPGYC4WY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPGYC4WY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPGYC4WY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
