window.products.push({"id":765187,"name":"Handheld Vacuum Cleaner, Cordless 12kpa Portable Vacuum Handheld Cleaner with 2600mah Battery & USB-C Charging, Lightweight Wireless Vacuum Cleaner Ha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qQhSDAmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Strong Suction & Low Noise】: The handheld vacuum cleaner uses a 100W high-power brushless motor and a powerful metal turbine, and has a safety system to prevent overvoltage, overcurrent and overheating. Two-stage suction design: 9000Pa/12000Pa, which can meet various cleaning needs while reducing noise. 【3 Sizes of Nozzles & Efficient Cleaning】: The portable handheld vacuum cleaner has three nozzles to deal with different objects - the large nozzle can help you clean most solid dirt, grain, grass, pet hair, sand, etc. Crevice nozzles are used for sofa seams, seat edges and debris. Brush nozzles are used to clean uneven surfaces such as carpets and keyboards. 【Reusable High-density Filter】: The handheld cordless vacuum cleaner uses a high-density filter with advanced technology, capable of capturing 99.9% of fine dust down to 0.3 microns. It can effectively filter dust in the air, making your space cleaner and fresher. Also, the HEPA filter is removable and washable so you can use it over and over again. 【Extensive Applicability】: The cordless vacuum cleaner handheld adopts an ergonomic handle, a light and flexible wireless design, and three suction nozzles, which can be widely used in various occasions. The working noise is lower than 70dB, it is an excellent choice for cleaning the car, kitchen, home, garden, office. 【USB Rechargeable Durable Battery】: The handheld vacuum cleaner cordless is equipped with a built-in powerful and efficient 2*2600mAh lithium battery, combined with fast charging technology, the charging time only takes 2-3 hours. Type-C charging design, charging anytime, anywhere. The switch's charging indicator light can help you know the charging status of the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qQhSDAmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lynker","source_asin":"B09QQ1P34K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QQ1P34K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QQ1P34K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
