window.products.push({"id":765230,"name":"Innsky 6.3 Qt Air Fryer( 32 Main Recipes &Grilling Rack Included), 1700W Electric Hot Air Fryers XL Oven Oilless Cooker, LED Digital Touchscreen, Auto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tvo6eRf-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Nutrition & Healthy Eating - Deep frying adds a lot of calories and Trans Fats which may increase the risk of Heart Disease, Diabetes and Obesity. Innsky air fryer cooks by 360° circulating hot air around the food and makes the food produce a crispy layer via the Maillard effect with 85% less oil. It doesn't deconstruct the good nutrients. Meanwhile, keep the food being delicious the same as deep frying. Vesatility & Saving Space - With a range of 180 to 400 ℉, this air cooker allows you grill, bake, and roast food. Not only can you make traditionally fried foods, but it’s also great for vegetables, proteins like chicken wings and drummettes, and appetizers like coquettes and feta triangles. Even desserts like brownies and blondies are perfectly baked in this air fryer. Maximize your culinary potential! No sweat, No tears - Easy-to-read LED touch screen with 7 presets allows you to cook different delicious effortlessly. Cooking is fast and free from splattering oil vapor all over your kitchen countertop. All removable parts go into the dishwasher. Washing by hand is easy too. No sweating cook in hot summer and troublesome cleanup after cooking. Auto Shut Off & Memory - This air fryer is designed to be shut down automatically when time is up which means you can set your air fryer and then forget about the food until it’s ready to eat. Halfway through cooking, you can also remove the basket to shake or add seasoning without interrupting the preset time or temperature. Strive To Be Your Best - Provide healthier fried food which makes it a great choice for Thanksgiving Day and Christmas Day, etc. Comes with a recipe book including 32 recipes, it will give you a few extra ideas if you are not sure what to make with this air fryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tvo6eRf-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Innsky","source_asin":"B07NW9YW5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NW9YW5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NW9YW5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":765231,"name":"Adeco Modern 50 Inch Rolled Armed Storage Ottoman Bench,Tufted Bed Bench Footstool with 170L Large Storage Space Weight Capacity 460lbs,Upholstered Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sqsO1YxWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MODERN CLASSIC STYLE】The tufted storage bench,combining a simplistic style with mid century design,features a refined straight line frame structure with elegant rolled arms and upholstered in durable linen fabric,which is breathable soft and resistant to wear yet not compromise any comfort.Tufted seat detail adds more elegance and noble luxury to your home. 【SUPERIOR COMFORT】The top of bed bench is filled with high rebound thick sponge for ultimate comfort and support when getting dressed in the bedroom or putting on shoes at the entryway. High-density sponges,thicker enough to make it less to deform that ensures comfortable sitting experience. 【STABLE AND ROBUST】A real storage bench that built to last.Using quality linen material,upholstered with thick padding and equipped with sturdy wooden legs,easy to clean and designed for years of use,the maximum weight capacity up to 460lbs,stable and robust enough for seating 2-3 people without a safety concern. 【AMPLE HIDDEN STORAGE SPACE】Overall size is 50.2 \"(L)x 16.9\"(W)x 25.2\"(H).with 170L volume which is a large storage space for storing your household items or other sundries you want to keep nearby but out of sight,like blankets,sheets,pillows,clothes,toys,books etc therefore keep your room tidy. Safety hinges to ensure the lid stay open and won’t fall down during use,which is convenient to close or open it. 【FUNCTIONAL&VERSTAILE】The stylish yet elegant window bench with extra large chest makes it a perfect bench at the end of the bed or storage footstools at walking-closet,entryway or a sofa bench provides extra seating for your guest in your living room.Great height and width as a step stool for lovely pets.100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE- If for any reason you're not 100% SATISFIED, please email us and we will help you RETURN OR REFUND.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sqsO1YxWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adeco","source_asin":"B09Q36RN7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q36RN7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q36RN7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
