window.products.push({"id":765234,"name":"KOKHUB Kitchen Mat and Kitchen Rugs 2 PCS, Cushioned 1/2 Inch Thick Anti Fatigue Waterproof Mat, Comfort Standing Desk Mat, Kitchen Floor Mat with Non","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QfASH3Y3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft as Clouds - KOKHUB Anti fatigue kitchen mat is made from high-quality gel foam and extra cushioned 1/2\" thick with ergonomically designed to relieve muscles and joints pressure from standing for a long time. Effectively alleviates back, leg, ankle, and feet discomfort for people daily work in the kitchen or those who need long-time standing such as chef, hairdresser. Best Kitchen Partner - The anti-slip feature is derived from a unique backing pattern & bevel edge design to keep the kitchen rugs and mats non-skid washable in place and prevent the risk of tripping. Stylish texture & Premium material surface on kitchen mats for floor ensures long-term durability and unfading. Easy Cleaning - Waterproof, oilproof, and stain-resistant features make cleaning a breeze, just wipe it down with a wet cloth or hand-held vacuum. The KOKHUB anti-fatigue mats are constructed with heavy-duty PVC outer lining that makes cleaning effortless due to its water and stain-resistant material. Best Size For You - Our kitchen mat size is 17.3\"x28\"+17.3\"x47\", thickness – 0.5\" (12mm). This small one is commonly used under single-door sinks and under cooktops, and the big one is generally put beside kitchen island. Applicable to multiple scenarios, kitchen, laundry room, bathroom, office, hallway, and any other high-traffic indoor or outdoor space. Fit for most kinds of flooring: tile, wood, marble, and more. Healthier Choice for Family - KOKHUB padded mats are made of the safest PVC material, that is phthalate-free, latex-free, and odor-free. With dual comfort core - soothing gel + energy-return foam, bringing safety and comfort to you and your family indoor or outdoor. Thus, this kitchen mat pad is a perfect gift for family and friends! Before Ordering - Different sizes for different situations. Please pick the favorite size you want and notice the thickness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QfASH3Y3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOKHUB","source_asin":"B09KZ5YQC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KZ5YQC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KZ5YQC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
