window.products.push({"id":765315,"name":"Everything Eco Empty Plastic Bottles with Caps, Bottle Brush and Collapsible Funnel. 20x 16 oz Bottles, Square Clear Bottles. Smoothie Bottle, Juice B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gRyCfQ8AL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"You Bring the GREAT Juice, We’ll Bring the Great Juice Bottles! While it may be easier to buy juice already packed in bottles, it’s much more satisfying to do it yourself, wouldn’t you say? But that’s only if bottles are easy to fill, drink from and clean – otherwise, it’s just a time consuming pain. So, we created a juice bottle set with a funnel and ounce markers on the bottle – to save you spilling things and using extra measuring cups. And, a double-sided cleaning brush that actually works! So you can clean your bottles faster and deeper for your next juice-scapade! Everything Eco Set of 20x NARROW MOUTH Clear Drinking Bottles with Lid 16 oz Water Bottles / Juice Bottles - Set of 20, with Leakproof Lids Features Floz Markers On The Side for Consistent Mixing! Comes with Water Bottle Cleaning Brush and TINY Funnel! PLUS + Juice Recipes and FUN Writeable Stickers to label each juice container Juice Containers with Lids for Fridge or Freezer 7.3 x 2.4in. Square Clear Plastic Bottles with a Satisfying Hand Feel and Fits All Cupholders Square Plastic Bottles for Liquids for Kids DIY Sensory Bottle Projects! Perfect for kids party supplies, corporate events, launches, Christmas tables and more! Strong BPA Free PET Plastic Juice Bottles with Caps – Won’t Pinch, Crack or Crease Gift Packed Plastic Bottles with Lids – Use some now, store some for later! Made in FDA Cert. Facilities, 100% Food Safe, Handwash Only Comes with 30-Day Return or Refund Guarantee What are we juicing first? With stronger plastic than other bottles, labels, brush, recipes and a promise to replace any clear bottle that didn’t survive manufacturing, try them now from Everything Eco!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gRyCfQ8AL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Everything Eco","source_asin":"B08FYV4QSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FYV4QSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FYV4QSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
