window.products.push({"id":765347,"name":"Dream Libery Linens Lightweight Super Soft Bedsheet King and Full Size (4 pcs and 6 pcs) (6-Piece, Gray with White Stars)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612EC1+4MmS._AC_SL1037_.jpg","description":"About Item The Dream Liberty Linen Sheet Collection is inspired by a green lifestyle. The entire collection is made of organic cotton and is chemical-free. Dream Liberty Linen is the breath of fresh air you've been looking for if you want to reconnect with nature. The Collection's timeless, subtle designs and colours soothe the mind and quiet the soul and are made from 100% organic cotton. Quality is at the heart of everything we do, from the materials we use to the thoughtful improvements we make. Matching bedding sheets and pillowcases, comforters, duvets, and pillows from the Dream Liberty Linens Collection add a designer touch to any bedroom. In a variety of sizes, our brand combines timeless beauty with stylish appeal. Features: Item: Bed Sheet Set  Blend/Material: 100% Organic Cotton  Textile Construction: Made of high-quality fabric in which the yarns are woven one by one. Weave texture is non-slippery. About Hand Feel: Cool Touch  Finish: Soft  Pattern: Solid  Hemstitching: 4\" Single Needle  Sheet Features: Ultra-light, Cool Touch, Moisture Wicking, Breathable, Color Staying Fibers.  Sets Includes: 4-pieces (1 Flat, 1 Fitted Sheet, 2 Pillowcases) & 6-pieces (1 Flat, 1 Fitted Sheet, 4 Pillowcases)  Mattress Depth: Fits Up to 18 inches  Laundry Care Instructions: Machine Wash, Tumble Dry, Do Not Bleach, Do Not Dry Clean, Warm Iron If Needed, Do Not Iron Elastic Organic Cotton vs Conventional Cotton Organic cotton is nature's finest material because it is grown without the use of chemical pesticides or fertilizers. Cotton production has a negative impact on local water quality and biodiversity when grown organically. This eliminates the need for farmers to use expensive chemicals, which is also beneficial to their health and has a lower environmental impact. The entire production process is certified organic by Global Organic Textile Standard (GOTS), from growing to harvesting, spinning, and dyeing. Our sheets are made in a way that respects the environment as well as the lives of the people who make them. A rigorous screening process ensures the safety of our bedding by allowing the use of ingredients that are not known or suspected to be harmful to human health, animals, aquatic life, or ecosystems.Other advantages of organic cotton include: Same high quality as conventional cotton.  Pure, Natural, and Hypoallergenic.  Zero use of pesticides or synthetic fertilizers.  Restrictions on genetically modified seed usage.  Doesn't damage the soil and has less impact on the air.  Adheres to Fair Trade Principles. Percale sheets are well-known for their trademark tight cotton weave. The term \"percale\" refers to the specific weave used to create the finished product. As a result, the weave is extremely durable, cool to the touch, and softens with each wash. For everyday sleep with a luxurious hotel suite feel, our organic cotton percale sheets are smooth, breathable, and hardly wrinkle. GREAT FIT: Unlike other fitted sheets, our sheets have elastic all the way around the edge for a secure fit that will not shift while you sleep!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612EC1+4MmS._AC_SL1037_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DREAM LIBERTY LINENS","source_asin":"B0BVWLN6SX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVWLN6SX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVWLN6SX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":765348,"name":"HO2NLE 2pcs Artificial Flowers Silk Daisy Plastic Chrysanthemum Outdoor Fake Flowers Faux Plastic Chrysanthemum for Home Wedding Hanging Garden Porch ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oKUL6L9-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feature： Rayon flowers are made of silk. The vivid and bright colors and greens can add vivid colors to the room. Plant bouquets never wither, participate in all seasons of the year, elegant yet dignified, and can be decorated with any home style. The yellow wild chrysanthemum is as warm as the sun, giving people hope, allowing you to enjoy the tranquility of life and feel the breath of nature after work. Specification: Material:silk cloth Size: 36cm*20cm Color: yellow Quantity: 2pcs The package includes: 2pcs artificial chrysanthemum Note： 1. Due to different monitors, there may be a slight color difference between the actual product and the picture, please forgive me. 2. In order to prolong the service life of the product, please do not expose the plants to the sun or rain for a long time. 3. Please allow 1-3cm error in manual measurement. 4. If you have any questions, please email us in time and we will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oKUL6L9-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HO2NLE","source_asin":"B08ZHWNYTX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZHWNYTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZHWNYTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
