window.products.push({"id":765401,"name":"Amconsure Bathroom Rugs Bath Mat Set, 3pcs Extra Soft and Absorbent Non-Slip Bath Rug, Microfibre Plush Bathroom Rug Machine Washable Bath Mats for Tu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dEyVVY-ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁【Ultra Soft 3 Pieces Bathroom Rugs】Amconsure Bathroom Rugs Set include 1 Small Bath Rug 17\"x24\", 1 U-Shape Contoured Rug 20\"x24\", 1 Large Bath Rug 20\"x32\". Our bath mat set adopts a fiber-lock technique that all clusters of the fiber floss are knitted tightly each fiber about 1 inch and more compact and thick to arrange together, the bath mats soft enough like sinking into a deep cotton pile while you step on it. 🎁【Super Absorbent and Fast-Drying】Amconsure bathroom rug are made of plush chenille which traps water and keeps your floors clean and dry. Soft Luxurious Chenille Shaggy Bath Rug, quality up to 1800g/sm weight, which make it of the strong water absorption, soak moisture instantly, moisture is trapped in the mat's deep pile which keeping the bath mat dry for a long time. The high piling fibers absorb moisture and dry quickly after you step out of the shower to a protector for your feet. 🎁【Non-Slip & Longer Lasting Material】The bath mat set using the premium environmentally friendly odorless adhesive PVC material to keep the mat firmly in place. As attractive bath rugs caring for your family, the non-slip mats are safer for kids and the elderly. The durable materials and high-quality construction ensure that it will not deteriorate, flatten or fall apart with use. Color will stay nice and vibrant for years to come no matter how many times they’ll be washed and dried. 🎁【Machine Washable & Easy Care】The premium construction of Amconsure Chenille Bath mats allow you to machine wash and dry without worry for years to come. DO NOT BLEACH and be sure to avoid fabric softener. Make sure to machine wash cold and tumble dry on low. After 10 times machine wash test, our bathroom mat still look as good as the new one. It's really easy to handle and care. In addition, we recommend that you wash it at least once a week which is good for hygiene and health. 🎁【For Any Occasion & Reliable Service】This bathroom carpet set not only a great choice for your home, bathroom, kitchen or toilet, spas, and anywhere else you need a premium bath mat. But also are the perfect gifts to lovers, family, and friends. Plus, Customer satisfaction is our first priority. If you are unsatisfied in any way with this microfiber shower rug, please don't hesitate to contact us by sending a message on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dEyVVY-ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amconsure","source_asin":"B09652FH4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09652FH4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09652FH4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":765402,"name":"Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick Stainless-Steel Double Boiler Insert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31515N3EEEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick stainless-steel double boiler should be the last double boiler you'll ever need. Unique tulip bowl shape design fits Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick 2-1/2-quart and 4-1/2-quart saucepans perfectly--but would work in any other saucepan as well. 18/10 stainless-steel construction is dishwasher-safe and carries a lifetime warranty. Buy the Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick steamer insert and you'll have a lid that fits your double boiler. Also works great as a fruit bowl on the counter. Amazon.com The high-quality Contemporary Nonstick line of cookware is designed to meet the needs of busy families while offering the high-quality construction associated with the Calphalon brand. These pots and pans offers a stylish, attractive look while making cooking and cleanup for family meals or special occasions easy and low-stress. Contemporary Nonstick cookware replaces Calphalons original and highly popular Professional Nonstick II line--but with improvements to make it even better. The most obvious enhancement is in the versatile rounded and flared design of the pots and pans. This design makes a single pan suitable for various cooking techniques and provides better access for pouring and stirring. Also convenient is the capacity line on these pots and pans, which helps prevent cooks from overfilling them. This stainless-steel double boiler is perfect for poaching fish, melting chocolate for desserts, or warming cream-based soups without heating them to boiling. The boiler has five perforations encircling it to draw steam heat in from the boiling water in your lower pan, heating food gently without burning or overcooking. Two ergonomic brushed stainless-steel loop handles stay cool to the touch on the stovetop and are riveted to the insert for durability. This cookware is dishwasher-safe and is covered by a lifetime warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde From the Manufacturer Get together with Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick. Sharing great food with friends and family is surely one of life's most delicious pleasures. And Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick makes it so easy to get together! Designed to fit your style of cooking, living and entertaining, Contemporary Nonstick features an exclusive nonstick interior, formulated for durability and effortless clean-up. (Our nonstick coating makes preparing healthy, low-fat meals a snap, too.) Constructed from heavy-gauge hard-anodized aluminum, Contemporary Nonstick cookware heats evenly, sears quickly and browns foods beautifully--and it's guaranteed to last a lifetime. Even a quick glance at Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick tells you, there's something exciting happening in the Calphalon Kitchen. You notice it in the cookware's gracefully curved vessels . . . in its elegantly arched, subtly polished handles and sparkling glass-and-stainless covers. We designed Contemporary Nonstick so you wouldn't dream of hiding it in the kitchen--you'll want to bring it right to the table. The Pot Lucky pan is just right for casseroles, risotto, mashed potatoes and more. Contemporary Nonstick's full-capacity line helps prevent over-filling and simplifies serving! Contemporary Nonstick cookware is designed for versatility. Vessels are shaped to accommodate several different techniques. Many feature two loop handles, to easily allow for both stovetop and oven cooking. (All Contemporary Nonstick pans are oven-safe to 450 degrees.) They're also perfect for serving--whether in the kitchen, dining room, living room or den. The Entertainer is a perfect example: it sautés, braises, or bakes with equal finesse! Contemporary Nonstick's stay-cool long handles make stovetop cooking more comfortable and convenient. Making omelettes to order is no problem--your Daily Sizzle pan's handle will stay cool no matter how many you have to flip! Pancakes, French toast, toast, and eggs over-easy all slide effortlessly from atop your Morning Glory pan. And clean-up takes no time at all, thanks to an exclusive Calphalon nonstick coating. The Morning Glory is also ideal for grilled sandwiches and veggie burgers. Don't make brunch--or lunch--without it! Some things can't be rushed. Pot roast, for example. And your Mama's marinara. From braised beef to simmering soups, Contemporary Nonstick cookware is the perfect choice for slow-cooking. Constructed from heavy-gauge hard-anodized aluminum, it heats gently and evenly--allowing spices to meld and mellow and meats to turn \"fork tender\"--without sticking or scorching. There are times when you barely have a minute to toss together soup and a sandwich. \"Heat-and-eat\" is the order of day. That's why Contemporary Nonstick includes pans of all shapes and sizes--for every day as well as entertaining. Your Short and Saucy pan is perfect for warming soups and sauces, cooking vegetables and much more. Contemporary Nonstick features: Hard-anodized exterior--nonstick techniques interior for easy clean up and the ability to cook with health","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31515N3EEEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B0000936JE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000936JE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000936JE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
