window.products.push({"id":765404,"name":"Bed Pillows for Sleeping 2 Pack Queen Size White, Gel Pillow with Soft Premium Plush Fiber Fill Skin-Friendly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W04XX67tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton ✅SUPER PLUSH MATERIAL – Our Sleep Restoration Gel-Filled Fiber Pillows are crafted in super plush gel fiber. They are expertly tailored to ensure maximum comfort for any and all sleeping positions. ✅MACHINE WASHABLE：Our bed pillows are machine washable at 30°C, fade resistant and stain resistant, so you'll never have to worry! The pillows for sleeping will always feel and look like new, no clumping! ✅FADE RESISTANT & STAIN RESISTANT – The sofore Luxury Gel-Filled Fiber Pillows are fade resistant and stain resistant, so you’ll never have to worry! They are allergen and chemical free which is perfect choice for those suffering from asthma, allergies, and other respiratory issues. ✅VACUUM-PACKED: These pillows are vacuum-packed, suggest waiting 24 hours before using it.With the pillow no-shift construction and never go flat, no matter what kind of sleeping positions you prefer, it can provide you the fluffy and cloud-like feeling. You’ll fall asleep fast, and stay asleep! ✅SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We are so confident in the quality of our product that we offer a 30-day satisfaction guarantee! If you are unsatisfied, simply contact us to return the product for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W04XX67tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sofore","source_asin":"B08749T8R1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08749T8R1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08749T8R1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":765405,"name":"Turning Leaves White/Black Hanging Mobile - 32 Inches - High Quality - Handmade in Denmark by Flensted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xIkoM1LNL._SL1059_.jpg","description":"How can I clean my mobile?Mobiles made of cardboard should only be dusted with a soft brush. Mobiles made of wood, aluminium or plastic can be wiped with a moist cloth with a few drops of mild dishwashing detergent.How long can my Mobile last?One person called us and said that they had inherited a Science Fiction Mobile from her grandmother who had had it for 30 years! In our home we have had the same mobile hanging for more than 20 years.Can my mobile hang outdoors?No. Since they are very sensitive to the simplest whiff of air hanging them outside is not recommendable.Will my mobile fade?In many of our mobiles we use plastic foil. This material is lightproof and easy to clean. Some other mobiles are made of cardboard. Even though we use the highest quality cardboard it will fade over the years. Red colors fade more than blue. You can delay fading by hanging the mobile out of direct sunlight.When hanging your mobile, try it in different places and bear in mind the following suggestions:1. The mobile is designed to be a pleasure to the eye and a stimulus to the imagination. Hang out of reach of children. It is not a toy.2. Hang it away from direct sunlight to avoid the colors fading and the shapes distorting.3. Hang it where there is some movement of air but no strong draft. A slow, quiet movement is the essence of the mobile. Do not hang it outdoors.4. Where practical, hang the mobile where it has a subdued, uniform background. A corner position against light-colored walls is often the best location.5. If possible, hang it in the light from a lamp. The shadow that the mobile casts onto a wall or ceiling will give the mobile yet another dimension. A candle is a concentrated light source which will produce distinct, well-defined shadows.6. Hang the mobile where you can watch it while listening to music. You will see the mobile move to the rhythm of the music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xIkoM1LNL._SL1059_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flensted Mobiles","source_asin":"B008D46W52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008D46W52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008D46W52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
