window.products.push({"id":765617,"name":"Farmhouse Knit Throw Pillow Covers, Set of 2 Lace Trimmed Edge Decorative Throw Pillowcases Stretchy Cushion Cases for Sofa Couch Chair, 22x22 inch, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ndh1ZR9AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FARMHOUSE STYLE DESIGN - Linen lace trim around the edges, making the couch pillow covers durable, also gives out an exquisite and elegant look. Lace style design adds a vintage touch to your couch, living room, bedroom, balcony, sofa, bed, car. Etc. SOFT AND COMFORTABLE - Texture fabric with 3D embossed pattern made of high-quality polyester fiber. Very soft and cozy like cuddling your favorite sweater. Skin-friendly for kids and pets. Vibrant color will not fade after washing. HOME DECOR - Refresh our decor and liven up our place efficiently with these beautiful stitching hidden zipper cushion cases. A good choice to repurpose our old throw pillows for fall winter home decoration. PACKAGE INFO - 2 Throw pillow covers included, 22 x 22 inches (55cm x 55cm), NO INSERT/FILLER INCLUDED. Please allow 1~2cm deviation because of hand-cutting and sewing.They are so stretchy that you could size up the insert for a fullness look. CLEANING GUIDE - Machine wash cold separately, gently cycle only, no bleach, Tumble dry low, and DO NOT IRON. If you have any problem with these pillow covers, feel free to contact us anytime, we will resolve it ASAP.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ndh1ZR9AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pallene","source_asin":"B095Y27772","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095Y27772","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095Y27772","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":765618,"name":"Deni 1630 Freshlock TurboSeal Vacuum Sealer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417X76SWYAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Buying food in bulk saves a lot of money—unless half of it goes bad in storage. The Deni Freshlock TurboSeal is the ideal way to preserve meat and vegetables in the freezer, locking in freshness and protecting against freezer burn. The system has an aerodynamic turbo fan, 3-channel nozzle and a heat selector switch to seal potato chips, cheese, rice and more in their original bags. A built-in cutter automatically slices each bag to the desired length and an exclusive Create-A-Pouch button allows you to attach sauces to entrée bags or sort ingredients for baking. Bags are microwave-safe, and can be used for boil-in-bag cooking. Includes one 11W\"x33L' Deni Freshlock Replacement Roll. Additional rolls sold separately. Imported. 4Hx6Wx17L\". Amazon.com A cost-cutting and space-saving alternative to the plastic storage containers that clutter up most refrigerators, this home vacuum sealer packages food in slim bags that keep food fresher twice as long. With its aerodynamic turbo vacuum, the machine draws air out of the storage bag in less than one minute and, using its patented MultiSeal three-wire sealing system, seals air out permanently so food retains its texture, flavor, and nutrients without spoiling as quickly. A unique heat selector switch adjusts to three different sealing temperatures, depending on the thickness of bag being sealed. In addition to the Freshlock system-compatible bags, the heat setting can be adjusted to reseal store packaging, such as plastic bags of potato chips, pasta, or sugar. Another exclusive feature is the Create-a-Pouch setting, which makes a series of connected sealed bags and is ideal for creating portions for dieters or singles, bundling daily dosages of vitamins or medications for travel, or packaging fresh-baked snacks for lunchboxes. A roll of 11-inch-by-33-foot polyethelene plastic wrap makes more than 60 bags and, using the sealer's cut-bag feature, can be sized to fit any food. Bags are safe in the freezer and can also go in the microwave or boiling water to reheat sauces, rice, or pasta. White strips running across the bags make it easy to label and date foods designated for long-term storage. The Freshlock vacuum sealer comes with an instructional video and is covered by a one-year warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417X76SWYAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deni","source_asin":"B0000CFLIJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CFLIJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CFLIJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
