window.products.push({"id":765732,"name":"UDAP BRCWC: No-Fed-Bear with Case (Bear Proof Food Canister)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VVzD6DE1L._AC_SL1051_.jpg","description":"One of the first signs you will see at the bear park in any zoo is 'Don't feed the bears'. This is so true in a bear's natural habitat too. There is an old familiar saying 'A FED BEAR IS A DEAD BEAR'. According the National Park Service, allowing a bear to obtain human food, even once, can result in aggressive, bear behavior. Aggressive bears are a threat to human safety and must be removed or destroyed. Help keep bears wild and safe. Do not feed the bears for any reason! Mandatory in many National Parks in the U.S.A. The NO-FED-BEAR' bear resistant container is the perfect size for your backcountry travels. Sometimes bigger is not always better. The canisters convenient size stores up to 4 days of food for one person without becoming cumbersome. TheNO-FED-BEAR' container stores perfectly in you backpack or by attaching it to the outside with the available storage case. Each canister is made of a bear proof polymer blend. NO-FED-BEAR' Canister case with webbing straps and and buckles; will allow the container to be fastened to a backpack, pack animal or hand carried.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VVzD6DE1L._AC_SL1051_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Udap","source_asin":"B075D7FKLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-765732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075D7FKLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075D7FKLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
